<title>USA: IBM tender fetches 90 pct of Edmark shares.</title>
<headline>IBM tender fetches 90 pct of Edmark shares.</headline>
<dateline>ARMONK, N.Y. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Business Machines Corp said Tuesday that 90 percent of Edmark Corp's 70 million outstanding shares were tendered in response to an IBM offer.</p>
<p>All tendered shares were accepted for payment at $15.50 each following completion of the tender offer on December 16, IBM said.</p>
<p>Any Edmark shares not purchased in the tender offer will be acquired by IBM when the merger is completed, which is expected to occur by the end of the week, IBM said.</p>
</text>
